WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980 line:17%
An audiologist may see the same diagnosis several times

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:03.620 line:17%
in a morning.

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.780 line:17%
Repetition can make it easier to overlook how new

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:09.340 line:17%
and difficult the experience is for each family.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.530 line:17%
That is habituation.

00:00:12.222 --> 00:00:14.770 line:17%
Assuming the next family has the same priorities is

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:15.570 line:17%
generalization.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.930 line:17%
Unconditional positive regard means treating each person with acceptance

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:22.270 line:17%
and respect even when they disagree with you.

00:00:23.468 --> 00:00:25.668 line:17%
Suppose a parent tells you they are tired of

00:00:25.668 --> 00:00:27.048 line:17%
carrying the whole device routine.

00:00:27.876 --> 00:00:29.238 line:17%
Let the full concern come out.

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:33.108 line:17%
Pause, then reflect what you heard: keeping this routine

00:00:33.108 --> 00:00:35.088 line:17%
going every day feels exhausting.

00:00:36.029 --> 00:00:38.868 line:17%
The parent can correct your understanding or explain which

00:00:38.868 --> 00:00:39.568 line:17%
part is hardest.

00:00:40.393 --> 00:00:42.088 line:17%
Now you can ask if they want to work

00:00:42.088 --> 00:00:43.548 line:17%
through one step together.

00:00:44.298 --> 00:00:47.318 line:17%
Listening, reflection, and a shared next step can move

00:00:47.318 --> 00:00:48.378 line:17%
the conversation forward.
